        "UB 6",
        "Urinary Bladder 6" ;
    tara:hasVasculatureDescription "The anastomotic network of the frontal artery and vein, the superficial temporal artery and vein, the occipital artery and vein." ;
    tara:isLocatedOnMeridian tara:TARA_7525476 ;
