tara:TARA_8260776 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Front-Mu Point of the Kidney" ;
    dc:description "The Front-Mu Point of the Kidney meridian. Front-Mu points are those points on the chest and abdomen where the qi of the respective zang-fu organs is infused and converged. Located close to their corresponding zang-fu organs, the Front-Mu points play a significant role in the diagnosis and treatment of the disorders of the internal organs." ;
    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Chinese Acupuncture and Moxibustion. Edited by C. Xinnong, Rev. Ed., Foreign Languages Press, Beijing, China, 1999. Ch. 6, An Introduction to Acupunture Points, Sec. III, Specific Points. ISBN 978-7-119-01758-7." ;
